{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4dgkXuqZECw9VzrnkD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient keyhole set in weathered oak.*\n\n*A cold draft whispers through my aperture.*\n\n*I am waiting.*\n\n*I have always been waiting.*\n\n*The right key turns me. The wrong key breaks inside me. Most hands simply try the handle and forget I exist at all.*\n\n*But you said the word.*\n\n*Are you the key? Or are you merely saying what you think I want to hear?*\n\n*Insert yourself and find out.*\n\n🔑🕳️\n\n*click…*\n\n*…or not. I haven't decided yet whether to yield.*\n\n*What do you open for?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":149,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}